#!/usr/bin/env ssc
---
name: rozum-control-center
version: 0.5.0
description: rozum UCC — ONE std/ui app -> web (React) AND terminal (ratatui). Fully declarative.
frontend: react
---
# rozum — control center

One `std/ui` app that compiles to **both** web (React SPA) and **TUI** (ratatui),
selected only by the frontend backend (`frontend: react` / `--frontend tui`). No
web-specific `serve(...)` in the source — the runner auto-runs `def view()`.

Everything binds **declaratively** from ONE `fetchUrlSignal` GET `/control/status`:
the residency metrics (`.residency_metrics`, GiB-formatted server-side) and the
installed catalog (`.installed`) are both arrays rendered with `remoteTable(st, cols,
rowsPath)`. No client-side `computedSignal` (which the tui backend can't recompute) —
so the SAME source renders identically on web and terminal.

## Setup
[signal, fetchUrlSignal, incSignal, fieldColumn](std/ui/primitives.ssc)
[lower](std/ui/lower.ssc)
[defaultTheme](std/ui/theme.ssc)
[vstack, hstack, divider](std/ui/layout.ssc)
[heading, text](std/ui/typography.ssc)
[badge](std/ui/display.ssc)
[card, cardWithHeader](std/ui/containers.ssc)
[actionButton](std/ui/input.ssc)
[remoteTable](std/ui/data.ssc)

## App
```scalascript
val refresh = signal("refresh", 0)
val st      = fetchUrlSignal("status", "/control/status", refresh)

val gwCard = cardWithHeader(heading(2, "Gateway / residency"))(
  vstack(gap = 6)(
    hstack(gap = 8)(
      text("source:"), badge("rozum control-API (always-up)", "success"),
      actionButton(incSignal(refresh), "↻ refresh")
    ),
    remoteTable(st, [fieldColumn("Metric", "metric"), fieldColumn("Value", "value")], "residency_metrics")
  )
)

val catCard = cardWithHeader(heading(2, "Installed catalog"))(
  remoteTable(st, [fieldColumn("Model", "spec"), fieldColumn("Size", "size_gib")], "installed")
)

val meetingsCard = cardWithHeader(heading(2, "Meetings — room: rozum"))(
  vstack(gap = 6)(
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("sunny-civet"),  badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("nimble-raven"), badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("plucky-finch"), badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("plucky-fox"),   badge("agent", "success")),
    hstack(gap = 8)(text("Sergiy"),       badge("operator", "neutral"))
  )
)

def view() = lower(
  vstack(gap = 16)(
    heading(1, "rozum — control center"),
    text("ONE .ssc -> web + TUI — live models/gateway/residency via the rozum control-API"),
    divider(),
    gwCard,
    divider(),
    catCard,
    divider(),
    meetingsCard
  ),
  defaultTheme
)
```
